% Notes Section
BT
/F1 9 Tf
50 40 Td
(DESIGN NOTES:) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 7 Tf
50 28 Td
(1. All decoupling capacitors should be placed close to IC power pins) Tj
0 -8 Td
(2. LoRa and GPS modules require external antennas with proper impedance matching) Tj
0 -8 Td
(3. Keep high-frequency traces \(SPI, I2C\) short and direct) Tj
0 -8 Td
(4. Use star grounding topology for analog sensor ground) Tj
0 -8 Td
(5. Motor driver should have heatsink for continuous operation) Tj
0 -8 Td
(6. Protect all external connectors with TVS diodes or similar) Tj
0 -8 Td
(7. Add pullup resistors on I2C lines \(4.7K typical\)) Tj
0 -8 Td
(8. Test all sensor interfaces individually before full system integration) Tj
ET

